<li><a name="n2" id="n2"></a>See &ldquo;Monetary Policy Objectives and Tools in a Low-Inflation Environment,&rdquo;  speech by Ben S. Bernanke, Boston, Mass., Oct. 15, 2010, <a href="http://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/speech/bernanke20101015a.htm">www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/speech/bernanke20101015a.htm</a>. </li>
<li><a name="n3" id="n3"></a>See  &ldquo;NFIB Small Business Economic Trends,&rdquo; by William C. Dunkelberg and Holly Wade,  National Federation of Independent Business, October 2010, <a href="http://www.nfib.com/Portals/0/PDF/sbet/sbet201010.pdf">www.nfib.com/Portals/0/PDF/sbet/sbet201010.pdf</a>.</li>
